04:55.041 --> 04:59.131
<b>You must be controlling the mosquitoes 
via some sort of signal.</b>

04:59.481 --> 05:02.341
<b>That would explain their mysterious behavior.</b>

05:03.051 --> 05:05.011
<b>So if I were to get rid of you, the leader,</b>

05:05.601 --> 05:07.851
<b>would the swarm also disperse?</b>

05:09.681 --> 05:13.191
<b>Our next meal is here. Go drain him dry.</b>

05:18.941 --> 05:19.941
<b>Incinerate.</b>

05:30.161 --> 05:32.161
<b>I am about to eliminate you.</b>

