<b>Stay right where you are.</b>

05:38.591 --> 05:41.341
<b>You, eliminate me?</b>

05:42.841 --> 05:43.921
<b>Go on and try!</b>

05:49.261 --> 05:50.181
<b>Gotcha.</b>

05:58.771 --> 06:01.111
<b>Damn mosquitoes!</b>

06:28.471 --> 06:29.721
<b>Incinerate.</b>

06:41.941 --> 06:44.281
<b>Maybe a leg next?</b>

