07:55.221 --> 07:56.261
<b><i>What's with this guy?</i></b>

07:57.221 --> 07:58.141
<b>It's in my mouth!</b>

07:58.891 --> 08:00.191
<b>You little—!</b>

08:00.191 --> 08:00.521
<b>Huh?</b>

08:01.351 --> 08:02.731
<b>What's that squirming over there?</b>

08:02.731 --> 08:04.021
<b>Wha—? Mosquitoes?!{It's… mosquitoes?!}</b>

08:06.071 --> 08:07.361
<b>You over there.</b>

08:08.281 --> 08:09.571
<b>Evacuate now.{cutting it at the keyframe cuts off more than a whole syllable}</b>

08:09.571 --> 08:11.281
<b>That swarm has a mind of its own{is conscious}.</b>

08:11.781 --> 08:14.031
<b>If it senses you, it will attack immediately.</b>

08:15.201 --> 08:16.281
<b>Seriously?</b>

08:16.661 --> 08:18.451
<b>That's bad. I gotta get—{we}</b>

08:52.491 --> 08:56.991
<b>Since you could speak, I thought you would have 
at least human-level intelligence.</b>

08:57.621 --> 08:59.041
<b>But you were just a bug.</b>

09:00.001 --> 09:03.411
<b>You brought all the mosquitoes together 
into one easy-to-burn swarm.</b>

09:04.421 --> 09:05.921
<b>When I spotted you,</b>

09:05.921 --> 09:10.631
<b>I confirmed there were no 
living beings within 500 meters,</b>

09:10.631 --> 09:13.091
<b>so I should have been free to fire away.</b>

09:13.931 --> 09:15.391
<b>Wait, that guy might have—</b>

09:15.391 --> 09:18.801
<b>Man, you saved me. You're amazing.</b>

09:19.181 --> 09:22.311
<b>What'd you do{ was that} just now? 
You totally made them bug out!{he's punning on "flash of light" and "anti-bug incense"}</b>

09:22.311 --> 09:23.561
<b>Ba-dum-tsh.</b>

09:25.391 --> 09:29.231
<b>Oh, I was just trying to make a joke 
about the mosquitoes being bugs, and…</b>

09:33.651 --> 09:36.321
<b>Imbecile!{kek}</b>

09:36.911 --> 09:39.831
<b>I no longer need those little ones.</b>

09:40.371 --> 09:41.541
<b>I mean,</b>

09:47.421 --> 09:49.171
<b>look…</b>

09:49.171 --> 09:51.461
<b>how strong I've become!</b>

10:08.401 --> 10:12.191
<b>Your punches can't even kill a little mosquito?</b>

10:16.451 --> 10:18.031
<b>Weakling!</b>

10:18.031 --> 10:19.371
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

10:19.371 --> 10:24.251
<b><i>The more blood she consumes, 
the more powerful she becomes.</i></b>

10:24.251 --> 10:26.791
<b>I think I'll have your head next!</b>

10:28.541 --> 10:30.841
<b><i>I let my guard down.</i></b>

10:30.841 --> 10:32.041
<b><i>I have{There's} no chance of winning.</i></b>

10:33.551 --> 10:36.801
<b><i>All I can do is self-destruct.</i></b>

10:37.841 --> 10:40.051
<b><i>Forgive me, Doctor…</i></b>

10:48.651 --> 10:50.021
<b>Mosquitoes… suck!</b>

10:50.021 --> 10:51.361
<b>Mosquitoes… suck!</b>

10:54.441 --> 10:55.361
<b>Hold on!</b>

10:57.401 --> 10:58.991
<b>Please tell me your name!</b>

11:00.321 --> 11:02.491
<b>Oh. It's Saitama.</b>

11:03.371 --> 11:05.491
<b>Please make me your {*}apprentice{*disciple}.{I'd like to be your disciple.}</b>

11:05.491 --> 11:07.371
<b>Oh, sure.</b>

11:10.381 --> 11:10.961
<b>Wha—?{Wait, what?}{What?}{Huh?}</b>

11:29.191 --> 11:30.151
<b>Master!</b>

11:37.991 --> 11:39.361
<b>You actually{really} showed up.</b>

11:40.071 --> 11:41.161
<b>Uh…</b>

11:41.161 --> 11:43.161
<b>It's "Genos," Master Saitama.</b>

11:43.951 --> 11:46.331
<b>Could you start by not calling me "master"?</b>

11:46.331 --> 11:46.871
<b>Teacher!{Professor!}{finally decided to go with something someone might actually, y'know, use in english}{nah that was a nice meme}{Teacher!}{Maestro!}{Master!}{Sensei!}</b>

11:46.871 --> 11:48.541
<b>Not "teacher" either!</b>

11:49.831 --> 11:52.581
<b>G{*\fax0.041\frz351.490\fsp-18.03}o{*\fax0.033\frz352.873\fsp-17.49}o{*\fax0.024\frz354.215\fsp-12.3}d {*\fax0.007\frz355.853\fsp-14.01}t{*\fax-0.002\frz356.928\fsp-12.375}h{*\fax-0.011\frz357.878\fsp-12.375}i{*\fax-0.019\frz358.827\fsp-17.25}n{*\fax-0.028\frz0.150\fsp-16.035}g{*\fax-0.037\frz1.380\fsp-11.385}s {*\fax-0.054\frz3.152\fsp-16.905}c{*\fax-0.063\frz4.450\fsp-22.935}o{*\fax-0.071\frz6.209\fsp-22.545}me</b>

11:49.831 --> 11:52.581
<b>t{*\fax0.059\frz352.875\fsp-11.28}o {*\fax0.018\frz354.368\fsp-12.33}t{*\fax-0.003\frz355.324\fsp-15.645}h{*\fax-0.023\frz356.538\fsp-14.58}o{*\fax-0.044\frz357.668\fsp-14.25}s{*\fax-0.064\frz358.773\fsp-10.95}e {*\fax-0.106\frz0.853\fsp-20.22}w{*\fax-0.126\frz2.421\fsp-15.645}h{*\fax-0.147\frz3.634\fsp-11.28}o {*\fax-0.188\frz5.739\fsp-19.44}w{*\fax-0.209\frz7.247\fsp-10.11}a{*\fax-0.229\frz8.031\fsp-7.77}it</b>

11:51.211 --> 11:52.581
<b>Go on home after your drink.</b>

11:53.091 --> 11:55.051
<b>I'm not looking for {*}an apprentice{*a disciple}.{any disciples}</b>

11:55.051 --> 11:56.841
<b>Hold on, you're back in one piece?</b>

11:56.841 --> 12:01.221
<b>Yes, my body is mostly mechanical. 
As long as there are parts, repairs are quick.</b>

12:01.591 --> 12:03.471
<b>You're an odd one.</b>

12:03.471 --> 12:06.271
<b>What kind of parts do you use, Master?</b>

12:06.271 --> 12:07.721
<b>Don't use any.</b>

12:08.121 --> 12:10.311
<b>What about the skin-colored 
armor on your head?</b>

12:10.311 --> 12:11.481
<b>Yeah, that's my skin.</b>

12:11.481 --> 12:15.111
<b>But that would mean you're bald 
despite being so young.</b>

12:15.111 --> 12:17.231
<b>Yes, I'm bald! What's your problem?!</b>

12:17.991 --> 12:21.031
<b>Me? You'll listen to my problems?</b>

12:21.701 --> 12:23.991
<b>No thanks. I'm good.</b>

12:24.831 --> 12:28.741
<b>Actually, four years ago, when I was 15, 
I was still a normal human being.</b>

12:28.741 --> 12:31.121
<b>Did you hear what I just said?</b>

12:31.451 --> 12:33.631
<b>Although we had to pinch pennies,</b>

12:33.631 --> 12:37.881
<b>my family and I lived a peaceful and fairly happy life.</b>

12:38.231 --> 12:43.631
<b>But one day, a crazed cyborg went 
out of control and attacked our town.</b>

12:44.011 --> 12:45.551
<b>The insane cyborg…</b>

12:45.551 --> 12:49.891
<b>Most likely, a faulty upgrade 
caused his brain to malfunction{an anomaly in his brain}.</b>

12:49.891 --> 12:52.481
<b>He destroyed everything in sight.</b>

12:52.481 --> 12:55.441
<b>Parks, schools, buildings, my house…</b>

12:55.441 --> 12:57.901
<b>He even took my family's lives.</b>

12:58.691 --> 13:00.481
<b>Miraculously, I survived.</b>

13:00.481 --> 13:05.661
<b>However, I was but a helpless 15-year-old, 
weary and alone in a ruined town.</b>

13:05.661 --> 13:08.791
<b>That's when Doctor Kuseno happened to pass through.</b>

13:08.791 --> 13:13.751
<b>Doctor Kuseno, a scientist for justice, 
was on a mission to stop the destruction</b>

13:13.751 --> 13:15.711
<b>caused by the rampaging cyborg.</b>

13:15.711 --> 13:20.761
<b>I begged{asked} Doctor Kuseno to perform 
augmentation surgery on my body.</b>

13:20.761 --> 13:23.931
<b>That's how I was reborn as a cyborg 
who fights for justice.</b>

13:23.931 --> 13:29.351
<b>I promised Doctor Kuseno that one day 
I would terminate the evil cyborg.</b>

13:29.351 --> 13:29.871
<b>I see—</b>

13:29.871 --> 13:31.811
<b>It's been four years since that day.</b>

13:32.181 --> 13:37.271
<b>I'm now 19, and I've been wandering from town to town, eliminating evil.</b>

13:37.271 --> 13:40.481
<b>I've destroyed countless monsters and criminal organizations.{The number of monsters and criminal organizations I have destroyed are too many to count.}</b>

13:40.481 --> 13:44.401
<b>But I have been unable to find 
any clues about the insane cyborg</b>

13:44.401 --> 13:46.781
<b>and have grown frustrated and restless.</b>

13:46.781 --> 13:50.621
<b>I find myself chasing a vision{image, specter, ghost, idea, phantasm} of that cyborg whenever I face my enemies.</b>

13:51.041 --> 13:54.161
<b>Then last week, when that 
mosquito monster appeared,</b>

13:54.161 --> 13:56.251
<b>I let my concentration slip.</b>

13:56.251 --> 13:59.551
<b>I was convinced I could not lose to 
anything but the rampaging cyborg,</b>

13:59.551 --> 14:03.381
<b>so I neglected to{ even} analyze the data on my opponent and rushed to confront her.</b>

14:03.381 --> 14:04.721
<b>The result, as you know,</b>

14:04.721 --> 14:07.221
<b>was that an opponent with 
immense strength bested me.</b>

14:07.221 --> 14:09.601
<b>If you, Master Saitama, had not been in the area,</b>

14:09.601 --> 14:11.391
<b>I would have undoubtedly been destroyed.</b>

14:11.391 --> 14:13.981
<b>Master Saitama, you saved my life.</b>

14:13.981 --> 14:18.561
<b>I owe Doctor Kuseno my life, 
but now I am also indebted to you.{My life that was once saved by Doctor Kuseno has now been saved again by you, Master Saitama.}</b>

14:18.561 --> 14:20.941
<b>That debt weighs heavily on me.{responsibility}</b>

14:20.941 --> 14:24.781
<b>I must not die until I destroy that cyborg.</b>

14:24.781 --> 14:25.571
<b>And to do that,</b>

14:25.571 --> 14:30.331
<b>I must continue fighting evil as a righteous cyborg 
until he appears before me one day.</b>

14:30.331 --> 14:31.871
<b>I need to get stronger.</b>

14:31.871 --> 14:34.411
<b>Last week, when I saw your attack,</b>

14:34.411 --> 14:37.041
<b>I knew I had to study under you 
as your {*}apprentice{*disciple}.</b>

14:37.041 --> 14:39.421
<b>If only I could be as strong as you, Master Saitama!</b>

14:39.421 --> 14:41.881
<b>I have an old enemy to defeat,</b>

14:41.881 --> 14:43.671
<b>and not just for my own sake{and the battle is not for me only}.</b>

14:43.671 --> 14:45.921
<b>It's for my hometown, 
and for Doctor Kuseno.</b>

14:46.341 --> 14:48.221
<b>I realize I am still inexperienced.</b>

14:48.221 --> 14:52.351
<b>But right now, I need enormous power 
so I can eradicate the greatest of evils!</b>

14:52.351 --> 14:53.391
<b>Doctor Kuseno is—</b>

14:53.391 --> 14:57.141
<b>Enough, you idiot! 
Keep it to twenty words or less!{I get the argument but...characters? in speech?}</b>

14:59.101 --> 15:01.941
<b>Mosquito Girl was defeated?</b>

15:01.941 --> 15:03.981
<b>With one strike, you say?</b>

15:03.981 --> 15:07.611
<b>Well, she was just{merely} a prototype, after all.</b>

15:11.701 --> 15:13.451
<b>Why is he naked?</b>

15:13.451 --> 15:14.791
<b>Unclear.{Unknown.}</b>

15:14.791 --> 15:15.621
<b>No matter.{Well, whatever.}</b>

15:16.081 --> 15:18.791
<b>He'll make an excellent specimen.</b>

15:18.791 --> 15:22.171
<b>We shall study his physiology, 
by force if necessary.</b>

15:22.921 --> 15:24.921
