15:30.011 --> 15:32.301
<b>Master, here's the short version:</b>

15:33.761 --> 15:37.641
<b>Please teach me how{the way} to become strong like you.</b>

15:40.021 --> 15:40.561
<b>Genos…</b>

15:40.561 --> 15:41.441
<b>Yes!</b>

15:42.401 --> 15:43.271
<b>How old are you?</b>

15:43.271 --> 15:44.781
<b>Nineteen.</b>

15:44.781 --> 15:46.241
<b>So young…</b>

15:46.241 --> 15:48.611
<b>I'm sure you'll surpass me in no time.</b>

15:48.611 --> 15:49.701
<b>Do you mean that?</b>

15:49.701 --> 15:54.451
<b>I'm 25 now, but I was 22 
the summer I started training.{when I started training in the summer.}{the fact that it was in the summer isn't really important, so cut it out for less awkward wording}{I put it back at some point}{also using digits vs spelling it out is a decision based on length}</b>

15:55.911 --> 15:57.201
<b>Sure, I'll teach you.</b>

15:57.791 --> 16:00.831
<b>But it won't be easy. Can you handle it?</b>

16:03.291 --> 16:04.001
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

16:06.261 --> 16:08.091
<b>Object approaching at high speed.</b>

16:08.091 --> 16:08.591
<b>It's here!</b>

16:08.991 --> 16:09.471
<b>What?</b>

16:13.351 --> 16:14.601
<b>My name is…</b>

16:14.601 --> 16:15.051
<b>Huh?</b>

16:17.981 --> 16:19.601
<b>Pay for my ceiling!</b>

16:20.441 --> 16:21.441
<b>So…</b>

16:21.441 --> 16:22.441
<b>Hm?</b>

16:22.441 --> 16:25.861
<b>It seems our advance agent, Kamakyuri, is down.</b>

16:25.851 --> 16:28.021
<b></b>R{*\fry10}e{*\fry20}ar

16:26.181 --> 16:28.241
<b>I can't sense him with my{muh} telepathy anymore.</b>

