16:33.861 --> 16:36.411
<b>Master, leave them to me!</b>

16:38.831 --> 16:40.661
<b>Don't break{bust}{crash through}{smash} people's ceilings!</b>

16:40.661 --> 16:42.541
<b>Oh, never mind.</b>

16:42.851 --> 16:45.171
<b>Can't you guys just use the door?</b>

16:49.811 --> 16:50.721
